e movie spin-off and  it was a huge success both in japan and  in the states released in cinemas  worldwide in december 2018 dragon ball  super broly shocked many with its box  office hall raking in more than 115  million dollars worldwide with those  numbers it's hardly surprising that  another dragon ball super movie is on  the way the name of the film was  revealed during a panel at comic con at  home 2021 dragon ball super superhero  executive producer akio wyoku said  there's two supers in there which is  great we really wanted to emphasize that  this movie is all about the superhero  vibes dragon ball creator akira toriyama  is keeping the plot details of this  highly anticipated anime under wraps for  now but he promised some extreme and  entertaining bouts in an official  statement the movie is due for release  in the united states on august 19 2022  the upcoming batgirl movie comes by way  of birds of prey screenwriter christina  hodson who wants to put a new spin on  the classic dc hero leslie grace will  star as gotham city vigilante barbara  gordon whose thirst for justice sees her  become batgirl she'll be joined by a  couple of familiar faces michael keaton  will reprise the role of batman while jk  simmons is set to return as commissioner  james gordon barbara's dad  how many of you are there  not enough  brendan fraser is also making his comic  book movie debut playing the  pyromaniacal villain firefly batgirl  will also feature the first openly  transgender character in a dc feature  film ivory aquino will play the titular  character's roommate alyssa yao bad boys  for life directors adil l arby and bilal  fala are helming this straight to hbo  max movie which according to some set  reports appears to be set at christmas  time grace shared a first look at her  comic accurate costume in january 2022  along with a quote from the batgirl year  one comic i use their expectations  against them that will be their weakness  not mine batgirl will come to hbo max  sometime in 2022  whenever eddie brock and venom team up  box office gold is sure to follow  combined the original venom and its  sequel let there be carnage earned a  whopping 1.4 billion dollars at the  global box office that's why it only  makes sense that sony would want tom  hardy back on the big screen as soon as  humanly possible in april 2022 the movie  studio went to cinemacon and announced  that venom 3 was indeed coming but  didn't release any further details about  the plot so what might we see in the  third film of the franchise will venom  meet up with his fellow anti-heroes from  sony's universe of marvel characters  like dr michael morbius will other  versions of the symbiotes be introduced  and will tom hardy's version of the  character finally cross paths with  spider-man at this point it seems like  everything is on the table and the  possibilities are as endless as the  multiverse itself  news that chris hemsworth and taika  waititi were teaming up for another thor  movie broke days before comic con 2019  but the biggest announcement came at the  event itself natalie portman is  returning to the franchise portman  appeared to be done with marvel after  the first two thor movies but her  character has developed significantly  since her last film appearance in a 2014  comic foster was deemed worthy to wield  thor's hammer and adopted the title  goddess of thunder sure enough the  trailers for love and thunder feature  jane taking a leading role as the new  thor jane  based on what we know so far it seems  like the fourth thor movie will find the  titular hero setting out on a journey of  self-discovery leaving behind the  guardians of the galaxy and falling  afoul of gore the god butcher christian  bale will be joining the mcu as gore  with russell crowe appearing as the  greek god zeus expect to see a few  familiar faces return too including  tessa thompson's valkyrie as well as  korg and meek whether love and thunder  can reach the heady highs of thor  ragnarok has yet to be seen but it sure  seems to be off to a good start thor's  next adventure lands on july 8th 2022  dwayne johnson has been teasing a black  adam movie for ages and he became  officially attached in 2014 taking to  twitter to share the news he was  originally supposed to debut as the  popular villain turned anti-hero in  shazam but execs decided he was too big  a character and needed his own solo  movie things really heated up during  dc's fandom event in summer 2020 when  the studio debuted a teaser made up of  stills created by dc artist jim lee and  instagram artist boss logic in the  comics black adam is a vengeful slave  who is granted the gifts of the wizard  of shazam and uses them for good before  being led astray the first dc fan dome  teaser made it pretty clear that the  movie will follow the same origin story  johnson returned to dc fandom in 2021 to  discuss the movie claiming that the film  has without question some of the biggest  action sequences i have ever been a part  of  he also revealed a snippet of footage  featuring black adam being set free by  some tomb raider type characters joe may  call it sarah will direct the movie  joined by an all-star cast including  aldis hodge as hawkman noah centeno as  adam smasher quintessa swindell as  cyclone and pierce brosnan as dr fate  black adam hits theaters on october 21st  2022  the upcoming sequel to marvel's smash  hit black panther suffered a massive  blow in 2020 with a heartbreaking loss  of chadwick boseman marvel has no  intention of recasting the role which  means the black panther mantle will be  handed over earlier than expected  there's precedent for this in the comics  t'challa's sister shuri has her black  panther training fast-tracked after he's  severely injured by villains loyal to  namor who has been teased as the  sequel's big bad many fans want leticia  wright's shuri to take the wakandan  throne in black panther wakanda forever  she's certain to play a major role in  the plot of course but things became  complicated when wright was involved in  an onset incident in august 2021  suffering a critical shoulder fracture  and concussion with severe side effects  things only got trickier a few months  later when the hollywood reporter  alleged that wright had been spreading  anti-vaxx conspiracy theories on set we  don't yet know the details of the film's  story but we do know that several new  characters will make their debut  dominique thorne's riri williams will  appear in the film ahead of her upcoming  disney plus series ironheart while  tenochuerta is rumored to have been cast  as neymor black panther wakanda forever  will be released on november 11th 2022  a sequel to 2018's aquaman seemed  inevitable the moment james wan's  underwater epic passed the billion  dollar mark at the box office in january  2019 deadline revealed that warner  brothers wanted juan to oversee  development of aquaman 2 and had given  the director permission to select his  own writer a few weeks later the  hollywood reporter confirmed that  aquaman co-writer david leslie johnson  mcgoldrick had been hired fans got to  see some behind-the-scenes footage of  the film officially titled aquaman and  the lost kingdom during dc fandom 2021.  juan promised that his follow-up will be  more mature than the original while  still being an exciting romp jason mamoa  has revealed that he's proud of the  sequel for tackling important  environmental issues patrick wilson who  returns as aquaman's half-brother orm  added that they were having a blast on  the sequel which will see yaya abdul  mateen ii as black manta notably johnson  mcgoldrick has confirmed that the second  aquaman movie is inspired by silver age  black manta comics the lost kingdom is  due to be released on march 17th 2023  the second spider-man into the  spider-verse post-credit scene offered a  major clue about where the sequel was  headed introducing viewers to miguel  o'hara aka 